# Files the scene never loads: kept on disk, left out of the scene so the Explorer neither converts nor downloads them.
# Keep this list short (folders and wildcards): the preview server matches every project file against every line on
# each request, and a long list made it time out. Check it with: node scripts/unused-assets.cjs
assets/animaciones
assets/images/story/lore-v2
assets/images/story/memory-0*.png
